<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18514" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀφροδισ-ιαστικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφροδισιακός, χάρις</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1311b16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνδυασμοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					1.339
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of men and
			animals, <i>lecherous, salacious,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				488b4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				1.624
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>aphrodisiac,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδέσματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					954a3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.241
			</span></i>.</div>
